SUMMARY:Tropical Plants Lunch and Learn July 31
DTSTAMP:20260730T054922Z
DTSTART:20260731T103000Z
DESCRIPTION:Explore lush\, vibrant tropical plants and learn how to bring a
	 bold\, exotic feel to your home or garden!\nJoin us for a special Lunch &
	 Learn at The Brookwood Café and discover beautiful tropical plants that t
	hrive in Texas landscapes. Enjoy a delicious lunch while gaining helpful t
	ips and inspiration from our experts. Each participant will also receive a
	 special take-home gift! \nJoin us Friday\, July 31\, 2026 at 10:30 AM \nB
	rookwood Café\n1502 FM 1489\nBrookshire. TX 77423 \nRegister Here! \n\n$45
	.00 (plus tax) includes a delicious lunch at the Brookwood Café.\nParticip
	ants will receive a special\, take-home gift!\nPLEASE NOTE:  If you would 
	like to sit with specific people\, please be sure to leave a note with the
	ir names in the Notes section when you check out.\n\nThank you for support
	ing the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood! \
	nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities \n  \nCA
	NCELLATION POLICY: \n\nFull Refund (100%): Requests made 7 or more days be
	fore the event date will be eligible for a full refund.\nPartial Refund (5
	0%): Requests made between 6 days and 48 hours before the event date will 
	be eligible for a 50% refund.\nNo Refund: Requests made less than 48 hours
	 before the event or on the same day as the event will not be eligible for
	 a refund.\n\n\n  \n\nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with dis
	ABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood!\n \nVisit our Events Calendar fo
	r the full schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.   \nChanging the way t
	he world thinks about adults with disabilities\n\nhttps://brookwoodcommuni
	ty.org/event/tropical-plants-lunch-learn-july-31/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Marke
	t
